I enter the office building.
The building is very bright.
It is a beautiful January morning.
I see my new colleague.
His name is Prakash.
Prakash smiles at me.
"Namaskaram, Maya," Prakash says.
"Welcome to our team."
"Namaskaram, Prakash," I reply.
"Thank you very much."
Prakash asks me a question.
"Do you have an entry badge?"
I reply.
"No, I do not have a badge," I say.
"I do not have an ID card now."
Prakash smiles again.
"No problem," he says.
I walk inside with Prakash.
I am very happy in the new office.
